    "description": "Fixes #898.\n1. claude.sh: when the resumed run fails with 'No conversation found with session ID', delete .claude-session-id and retry ONCE without --resume (full prompt). Any other failure is not retried and keeps its exit code.\n2. .claude-session-id is added to the runtime artifacts that auto-save/commit staging excludes and untracks, so a session id no longer travels through git.\nTests: stale-session case (2 claude calls, retry has no --resume, id replaced, exit 0) fails on the old script; non-stale failure keeps exit 1 and is not retried; gitStaging 11/11."
